current.changeLog:
1. Adds Irene Engel and Wilhelm Strasse and includes approved Japanese male/female corrections. ;
2. Organises local audio by category and improves selective generation, integrity, reuse, migration and recovery. ; 
3. Superseded owned copies are retired only after their replacements are validated and the game exits normally. ;
4. A regional calendar manages Babylon's exclusive voices while retaining its themes and permanent content. ;
5. Adds family/gender filters, clarifies resource states and improves localised notices. Updates History and credits. ;
6. Both frames now default to an overall scale of 80%, with matching sizes in Preview and battle. ;
7. Only the first start of 1.2.0 resets all settings, with a recoverable backup. Subsequent starts and later versions preserve customisations. ;
